### 6. THE ARITHMETIC-SPELLING CHECK

  impl::ternaryDifference writes  pos = a & ~b; neg = b & ~a; mag = pos | neg
  the hand-written arm writes      mag = a ^ b;  sign = b & ~a
  Same function of the same inputs, spelled in four operations and in two.
  X-21 asserted the arms hold the arithmetic equal; whether they do is a
